From 3684ea36b482005b98f412bb7180310b99262a95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "sh.chao" <sh.chao@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 09:40:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] r25-2-0095: add bounded ordered line range index

Extend r25-2-0094 with conservative holder-space bounds over 64-line leaves and 64-leaf coarse ranges. Build the hierarchy during the existing parser append, retain command-range metadata for later ordered execution, and fail open for unknown bounds.

Query the actual inverse-transformed device clip without allocating candidate storage and emit shadow-only culling telemetry. Enforce the 96 MiB ceiling against actual retained capacity and keep canonical PDFium as the sole pixel owner.
